Rez was a wild game. I can't think of a single other first-party console game that came with a sex-toy (
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rez_(video_game)#Game_design
).

Click the "lets go" button once, then open the browser dev tools and paste following javascript:
```
for (var i = 0; i < 2000; i++) {
setTimeout(() => {
document.getElementById("go").click();
}, 50 * (i + 1));
}
```
